## MERGE-08 — Authorization and bank workflow

- Added farmer-controlled GreenFin authorizations with an explicit institution, purpose, data scope, start time, expiry time and revocation state.
- Validated the target institution against active GFES institution accounts and limited one authorization to at most 366 days.
- Added server-side authorization enforcement for institution access: institution identity, allowed data scope, active period and revocation state are checked for every detail request.
- Added GreenFin bank-case creation and an institution workspace that only exposes authorized experience, indicators and Data Health.
- Added `AUTHORIZATION_GRANTED`, `AUTHORIZATION_REVOKED` and `BANK_DATA_ACCESSED` audit writes, including actor and access context.
- Kept all GreenFin outputs separate and retained the explicit boundary that the information is supplemental and does not make lending decisions.

