## MERGE-09 — Traceability, report and full regression

- Added an institution-only `/api/greenfin/reports` route that rechecks the active authorization before generating a report.
- Added an evidence-lineage package connecting each authorized result to its calculation trace, rule version, standardized record, OCR fields, verification／anomaly records and original document metadata.
- Added JSON report download from the institution workspace and recorded both bank access and report generation audit events.
- Cached the runtime schema bootstrap per D1 binding to prevent concurrent local requests from repeatedly executing the full schema setup.

